{"id":"000VD6","title":"Polka Polka (Kropki Pairs Diagonal)","author":"tallcat","solvedCount":194,"difficulty":2,"rating":"96 %","firstSeen":"2026-10-17T17:33:19+00:00","posted":"am 10. Oktober 2026, 06:00 Uhr","rules":"This is another in a series of SudokuCon Banner inspired puzzles (it started with \"Uncork\" and there are a few more to come). When I began to work on it, I had something of a realization that I had never set a 'solo' Kropki pairs puzzle before. While this isn't strictly that of course (given the involvement of the diagonal), it nonetheless was a lot of fun to play around with. As you can see, my love of symmetry also comes through loud and clear. Happy solving!\n\nNormal sudoku rules apply\n\nKropki Pairs: For cells separated by a black dot, one value is double the other. Cells separated by a white dot are consecutive. Not all dots are necessarily given.\n\nDiagonal: The digits 1-9 must appear exactly once on the negative diagonal\n\nCan be found at Sudokupad","solutionCode":"Row 5 (left to right). 9 digits, no spaces.","tags":["Sudoku","Kropki Pairs (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/z9yr3gni1p","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/z9yr3gni1p","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","overlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-10-17T17:33:19+00:00"}